! assign-expr: assignment operator on enumerators is non-standard
  @ test.idl:3:19

 2 │ enum Level {
 3 │     LOW = 1,
   │           ˆ non-standard assignment
 4 │     MEDIUM = 5,
 5 │     HIGH = 10

  ? use the `@value` annotation instead

